Maintainer: Mitsuko G1 Linux community package
Description: Control and synchronize the Mitsuko Phantom G1 light strip
 Desktop controls for the Phantom G1, including USB HID control, built-in
 firmware effects, live PipeWire music reactive modes, screen sync, and paired phone control over Wi-Fi or USB, including iOS Bonjour discovery.
